- Practiced Docker Volume commands

## Commands Practiced

`bash
docker volume ls
docker volume create mydata
docker volume inspect mydata
docker compose up -d
docker compose down
```

## Key Learning

- Volumes help keep data safe even if containers are removed.
- Bind Mount shares files from the host system.
- Named Volumes are managed by Docker.
- Environment Variables help keep configuration separate from application code.

